{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 53, :comments ["<b>The god of their father.</b> Laban said: you cannot object to what I have designated as judge — <b>the god of Nahor</b> together with <b>the god of Abraham</b> — for indeed <b>the god</b> of Nahor was the god of Terah, who was the father of both Abram and Nahor." "<b>And Jacob swore by the Fear of his father Isaac.</b> For Isaac is not a son of Terah, and he swore that the god of Isaac alone shall judge if either betrays the covenant."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:53.350871460Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}